## Network Connection – Kuunganisha na Mother Source

Nexas ina kipengele cha Network Connection kinachohakikisha app inaunganika salama na **mother source** kwa ajili ya kusawazisha profiles, thresholds, na arifa. Kitambulisho cha chanzo (mfano: `Mama1956407897`) hutumika kama sehemu ya configuration na huhifadhiwa kwa usalama.

### Vipengele vya Kuunganisha na Mother Source
- **Connectivity check:** Mfumo hukagua kama kuna internet (Wi‑Fi/Data) kabla ya kuwasiliana na mother source.
- **Secure requests:** Mawasiliano hufanywa juu ya HTTPS na hutumia API key/token kwa uthibitisho.
- **Retries & timeouts:** Jaribio la kurudia maombi na muda wa mwisho ili kuzuia kukwama.
- **Config‑driven:** Vigezo kama `mother_source_id`, `api_base_url`, na `api_key` vinawekwa kwenye `.env` au Encrypted Storage.
- **Offline‑first:** Ikikosa mtandao, data huhifadhiwa local na kusawazishwa baadaye.

### Chaguzi za Configuration
| Chaguo             | Maelezo                                      | Mfano                  |
|--------------------|-----------------------------------------------|------------------------|
| `mother_source_id` | Kitambulisho cha chanzo cha data              | Mama1956407897         |
| `api_base_url`     | URL ya chanzo cha data                        | https://mother.source/api |
| `api_key`          | Token ya ufikiaji (hifadhi kwa usalama)       | (env variable)         |
| `request_timeout`  | Muda wa mwisho wa ombi                        | 15s – 30s              |
| `retry_policy`     | Idadi ya majaribio ya kurudia ombi            | Exponential backoff x3 |

### Mfano wa Pseudo‑Code (Android/Kotlin)
```kotlin
fun hasInternet(context: Context): Boolean {
    val cm = context.getSystemService(Context.CONNECTIVITY_SERVICE) as ConnectivityManager
    val network = cm.activeNetwork ?: return false
    val caps = cm.getNetworkCapabilities(network) ?: return false
    return caps.hasCapability(NetworkCapabilities.NET_CAPABILITY_INTERNET)
}

data class MotherSourceConfig(
    val motherSourceId: String = "Mama1956407897",
    val apiBaseUrl: String = "https://mother.source/api",
    val apiKey: String = System.getenv("NEXAS_API_KEY") ?: ""
)

fun syncProfiles(context: Context) {
    if (!hasInternet(context)) {
        cacheSyncRequest("profiles")
        return
    }

    val cfg = MotherSourceConfig()
    val client = OkHttpClient.Builder()
        .connectTimeout(15, TimeUnit.SECONDS)
        .readTimeout(20, TimeUnit.SECONDS)
        .build()

    val request = Request.Builder()
        .url("${cfg.apiBaseUrl}/profiles?source=${cfg.motherSourceId}")
        .addHeader("Authorization", "Bearer ${cfg.apiKey}")
        .build()

    client.newCall(request).execute().use { resp ->
        if (resp.isSuccessful) {
            saveProfilesLocally(resp.body?.string().orEmpty())
            notifyUser("Profiles updated from mother source.")
        } else {
            notifyUser("Sync failed. Will retry.")
        }
    }
}￼Enter
